Usage is reported.
RUN: env FRONT_SUBSTEPS=0 not %t.sequential2 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=USAGE
USAGE: FRONT_SIZE and FRONT_SUBSTEPS must be at least 1 and FRONT_STEPS at least 2.
